       All routines except wwiinnnnwwssttrr may be macros.

       Each  cell in the window holds a complex character (a spacing character
       and zero or more non-spacing characters) together with  attributes  and
       color.   These  functions  store only the wide characters, ignoring at‐
       tributes and color.  Use iinn__wwcchhssttrr to  return  the  complex  characters
       from a window.

       Reading a line that overflows the array pointed to by _w_s_t_r with iinnwwssttrr,
       mmvviinnwwssttrr, mmvvwwiinnwwssttrr or wwiinnwwssttrr causes  undefined  results.   Therefore,
       the use of iinnnnwwssttrr, mmvviinnnnwwssttrr, mmvvwwiinnnnwwssttrr, or wwiinnnnwwssttrr is recommended.

